Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.67,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,Miras alınan irade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:17.58,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,zamanın gelgitleri ve insanların hayalleri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.41,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,Bunların önüne geçilemez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:23.52,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,Özgürlüğe aç olan insanlar oldukça...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.15,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,bunlar hep var olacak.
